[2026-09-16T17:39:14.6028837] Bienvenue dans T4C Reborn.
[2026-09-16T17:39:17.404369] GM: Rebirth performed (remort 3)
[2026-09-16T17:39:29.8412687] Welcome, young one. I am here to assist you in preparing for your new life.
[2026-09-16T17:39:33.6040748] Vous : assiust
[2026-09-16T17:39:35.4578981] You have energy to spend. Speak with my associates, then return when it is all spent.
